WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.230
Bradford.

2
00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:05.830
An inner city at its heart;
suburbs and towns further out.

3
00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:11.270
At the 2021 census, about one Bradford
resident in four belonged to the Pakistani

4
00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.710
ethnic group.

5
00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:15.030
Their homes are not spread evenly.

6
00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.850
Most of the clusters
lie in the inner city.

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.870
Why do some migrant communities
cluster in the poorest neighbourhoods?

8
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:24.210
And do their grandchildren stay?

9
00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:27.510
In this mission, you'll measure
how uneven a pattern is,

10
00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:31.830
and test which measures of local
life track it most closely.

11
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.190
Then you'll follow change
across generations,

12
00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:38.630
and see how people read the
same streets in different ways.

13
00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:43.150
Your mission: find out why migrant communities
cluster in the poorest neighbourhoods,

14
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.640
and whether their grandchildren stay.
